    "The <0>{0}</0>-day rule is a reviewed guardrail, not a physiological cutoff.": "<0>{0}</0> 天规则是经过审查的护栏，不是生理学截止线。",
    "The 42-day rule is a Praxys pilot guardrail, not a physiological cutoff.": "42 天规则是 Praxys 的试点护栏，不是生理学界值。",
    "The accepted <0>{0}</0>-day proposal and <1>{1}</1>-day reassessment, one quality session per week, at least <2>{2}</2> planned low-intensity running minutes, history- and constraint-capped schedule, and the exact two quality templates are Praxys guardrails. They are not published optima or promises of efficacy or safety.": "已接受的 <0>{0}</0> 天计划与第 <1>{1}</1> 天复评、每周一次质量训练、至少 <2>{2}</2> 的计划低强度跑步时长、受历史与约束上限限制的训练安排，以及两套固定质量训练模板，均属于 Praxys 护栏，并非已发表的最优方案，也不承诺效果或安全性。",
    "The accepted deterministic policy has one shared maximum-session field. Praxys will not invent a per-day rule or silently reduce your schedule; use one limit for all selected days.": "已接受的确定性政策只有一个共享的单次训练上限字段。Praxys 不会臆造按日规则，也不会悄悄缩减你的安排；请为所有选定日期使用同一个上限。",
    "The accepted Praxys evidence review found controlled support for heat-related cardiovascular drift, but no field study validating a causal or predictive personal Stull wet-bulb response curve. V1 is therefore descriptive and Stryd-only.": "已接受的 Praxys 证据评审支持热环境相关的心血管漂移，但尚无实地研究验证具有因果或预测能力的个人 Stull 湿球温度响应曲线。因此 V1 仅作描述，并且只支持 Stryd。",
    "The active load model uses a {loadTimeConstantDays}-day long-term time constant. Need {daysToPmc} more days of history.": "当前负荷模型的长期时间常数为 {loadTimeConstantDays} 天，还需要 {daysToPmc} 天历史数据。",
