    "The canonical Praxys plan is preserved. Existing target workouts stay in place until you resume or leave.": "Praxys 计划会完整保留。恢复下发或退出托管前，目标平台上的现有训练保持不变。",
    "The chronological holdout and sensitivity checks passed, but this personal historical association is still not a clinical claim or future-condition forecast.": "时间顺序留出检验和敏感性检查已通过，但这一私人历史关联仍不构成临床结论，也不能预测未来环境下的表现。",
    "The chronological prediction check could not be evaluated, so Praxys withholds the fitted curve.": "无法评估按时间顺序进行的预测检查，因此 Praxys 不显示拟合曲线。",
    "The consent text changed. Review and confirm the current version.": "同意说明已更新。请阅读并确认当前版本。",
