    "The open proposal was built for your previous Goal and can no longer be adopted. Review a fresh proposal now or decide later.": "当前草案基于之前的目标，已无法采纳。现在查看新草案，或稍后再决定。",
    "The optional 5K pilot test is in progress.": "可选 5 公里试点测试正在进行。",
